{"3717840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NULL Train", "steam_appid": 3717840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULL Train</strong> is a 2D pixel-art roguelike where you fight, adapt, and survive your way through an endless, procedurally-generated sci-fi train. Each train car is a new level — some filled with enemies, some with hazards, or strange physics like zero gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through, collect items to unlock permanent upgrades, and try to push further with each run. When you die, it’s back to the start — but with better gear, sharper reflexes, and a new strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling combat with melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks, energy swords, and futuristic gear to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized train cars: enemies, multi-floor layouts, gravity shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression system: earn &quot;ticket stubs&quot; to unlock skills, weapons, and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty sci-fi pixel art style with atmospheric lighting and cinematic vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for replayability, learning, and experimentation — every run is different</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Currently available in English.</i><br>Localization into additional languages may come in a future update. Let us know which languages you'd like to see via the community hub!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULL Train</strong> is a 2D pixel-art roguelike where you fight, adapt, and survive yo